mooth curve $C,$ then $F(x,y,z)=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14060128/state.json" "file_sha256" "607957d5c1c86bc1a6cbc810c862d313142021b91e329b21542c17971ce6ec95"} {"question" "q-125423" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Given a piecewise-smooth path $C$ and a vector field \n\n$$\nF(x,y,z)=P(x,y,z)\\,i+Q(x,y,z)\\,j+R(x,y,z)\\,k\n$$\n\ndefined on $C,$ we have\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r={\\int }_{C}P\\,\\text{d}x+Q\\,\\text{d}y+R\\,\\text{d}z\n$$\n\nIn our case, $P={x}^{2},Q=-y,R=2z.$ Therefore\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{C}({x}^{2}\\,i-y\\,j+2z\\,k)\\cdot \\text{d}r & ={\\int }_{C}{x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x-y\\,\\text{d}y+2z\\,\\text{d}z.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, $F={x}^{2}\\,i-y\\,j+2z\\,k.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14060128/state.json" "file_sha256" "607957d5c1c86bc1a6cbc810c862d313142021b91e329b21542c17971ce6ec95"} {"question" "q-125423" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14060128/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "07849ef2f32f1ba0e1c09dfd9bc0c36c6ace0ddb24f49ed3bfac5595ae9949cf"} {"question" "q-125423" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14060128/state.json" "file_sha256" "607957d5c1c86bc1a6cbc810c862d313142021b91e329b21542c17971ce6ec95"} {"question" "q-125423" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "2x\\,i-j+2\\,k"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{2}∇({x}^{2}-y+2z)^{2}"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{3}{x}^{3}\\,i-\\frac{1}{2}{y}^{2}\\,j+{z}^{2}\\,k"] ["math" "{x}^{